    "version": "0.1.0",
    "min_herdr_version": "0.7.0",
    "description": "An fzf command palette for herdr: pops up a fuzzy-searchable list of every action exposed by every installed plugin (via `herdr plugin action list`) and invokes the one you pick. The picker runs in an overlay pane so fzf gets a real TTY; the origin workspace's cwd is forwarded so context-aware actions resolve the right repo.",
